    <item>
      <title>Solved: How to Add Information to an Exception Duplicate in Python</title>
      <link>https://sqlpey.com/python/solved-how-to-add-information-to-an-exception-duplicate/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 01 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sqlpey.com/python/solved-how-to-add-information-to-an-exception-duplicate/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;how-to-enhance-exception-messages-in-python&#34;&gt;How to Enhance Exception Messages in Python&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Raising exceptions with enhanced messages can be crucial for debugging and understanding the context of an error. Here, we explore various methods to append information to exception messages effectively in both Python 2 and Python 3.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;practical-example-raising-and-enhancing-exceptions&#34;&gt;Practical Example: Raising and Enhancing Exceptions&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Consider the following code snippet that raises an &lt;code&gt;IOError&lt;/code&gt; with a custom message when an error occurs:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;foo&lt;/span&gt;():&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;raise&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;IOError&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Stuff&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;except&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Exception&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; e:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;raise&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;bar&lt;/span&gt;(arg1):&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        foo()&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;except&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Exception&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; e:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;raise&lt;/span&gt; type(e)(str(e) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39; happens at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;%s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt; arg1)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;bar(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;arg1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
